<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  :root {
    --primary-blue: #004B87;
    --secondary-blue: #0072CE;
    --accent-teal: #008578;
    --accent-amber: #FFB81C;
    --light-bg: #F5F7FA;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
    --dark-text: #222222;
    --gray-text: #555555;
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: var(--light-bg);
    width: 2384px;
    height: 3371px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .poster {
    width: 2200px;
    height: 3180px;
    background: var(--white);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: 250px 300px auto auto auto;
    gap: 40px;
    padding: 80px 100px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
    border-top: 30px solid var(--primary-blue);
  }

  .header {
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 4px solid var(--accent-amber);
    padding-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .header h1 {
    font-size: 85px;
    color: var(--primary-blue);
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .header h2 {
    font-size: 42px;
    color: var(--gray-text);
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 50px;
    color: var(--primary-blue);
    margin: 0 0 40px 0;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .grid-2col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
  }

  .metrics-block {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: var(--primary-blue);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 60px;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }

  .metric-item {
    text-align: center;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .metric-item:not(:last-child) {
    border-right: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
  }

  .metric-value {
    font-size: 90px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--accent-amber);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .metric-label {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 0 40px;
  }

  .metric-label small {
    display: block;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    margin-top: 10px;
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: normal;
  }

  .chart-container {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 500px;
    background: #FAFBFC;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 30px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border: 1px solid #E1E4E8;
  }

  #c_risks { height: 650px; }
  #c_policy { height: 750px; }
  #c_strategic { height: 600px; }
  #c_research { height: 600px; }

</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="poster">

  <div class="header">
    <h1>Global Economic Prospects: Resilience Amid Uncertainty</h1>
    <h2>The global economy has recovered strongly from the 2020 recession, but vulnerable economies lag behind as trade tensions and policy uncertainty cloud the outlook.</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="metrics-block">
    <div class="metric-item">
      <div class="metric-value">6 Decades</div>
      <div class="metric-label">Strongest Recovery <small>Benchmark since the 2020 recession</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-item">
      <div class="metric-value">1.2 Billion</div>
      <div class="metric-label">Youth Entering <small>Working age in the next decade</small></div>
